Package: ZymoR
Type: Package
Title: Rapid Identification of Cyp51 Haplotypes and Fungicide Resistance Markers
Version: 1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Mateusz", "Mazdziarz",
      email = "mateusz.mazdziarz@uwm.edu.pl",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: ZymoR is a package for rapid identification of Cyp51 haplotypes in 
    Zymoseptoria tritici. The package also detects mutations in CYTB and SDH genes 
    associated with fungicide resistance, as well as insertions in the promoter 
    regions of CYP51 and MFS1.
